---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Kanban Overview">
  <h1>Kanban</h1>
  <p class="muted">Task management inside the app.</p>

  <h2>Core concepts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Multiple workspaces</li>
    <li>Columns with titles and colors</li>
    <li>Cards with priority, reminders, and completion state</li>
    <li>Drag & drop for cards and columns</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Persistence</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Kanban state is stored locally in app storage (via persisted atoms), not in your vault files.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>

